{"issue": {"url": "https://api.github.com/repos/mavlink/MAVSDK/issues/2319", "repository_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/mavlink/MAVSDK", "labels_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/mavlink/MAVSDK/issues/2319/labels{/name}", "comments_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/mavlink/MAVSDK/issues/2319/comments", "events_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/mavlink/MAVSDK/issues/2319/events", "html_url": "https://github.com/mavlink/MAVSDK/issues/2319", "id": 2321974619, "node_id": "I_kwDOBabE0s6KZoVb", "number": 2319, "title": "MAV_RESULT_IN_PROGRESS: Sigfault when multiple IN_PROGRESS messages are sent before arming", "user": {"login": "RaubCamaioni", "id": 17629859, "node_id": "MDQ6VXNlcjE3NjI5ODU5", "avatar_url": "https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17629859?v=4", "gravatar_id": "", "url": "https://api.github.com/users/RaubCamaioni", "html_url": "https://github.com/RaubCamaioni", "followers_url": "https://api.github.com/users/RaubCamaioni/followers", "following_url": "https://api.github.com/users/RaubCamaioni/following{/other_user}", "gists_url": "https://api.github.com/users/RaubCamaioni/gists{/gist_id}", "starred_url": "https://api.github.com/users/RaubCamaioni/starred{/owner}{/repo}", "subscriptions_url": "https://api.github.com/users/RaubCamaioni/subscriptions", "organizations_url": "https://api.github.com/users/RaubCamaioni/orgs", "repos_url": "https://api.github.com/users/RaubCamaioni/repos", "events_url": "https://api.github.com/users/RaubCamaioni/events{/privacy}", "received_events_url": "https://api.github.com/users/RaubCamaioni/received_events", "type": "User", "user_view_type": "public", "site_admin": false}, "labels": [{"id": 629977267, "node_id": "MDU6TGFiZWw2Mjk5NzcyNjc=", "url": "https://api.github.com/repos/mavlink/MAVSDK/labels/bug", "name": "bug", "color": "ee0701", "default": true, "description": null}], "state": "closed", "locked": false, "assignees": [], "milestone": null, "comments": 4, "created_at": "2024-05-28T21:47:35Z", "updated_at": "2024-06-28T18:03:54Z", "closed_at": "2024-05-30T19:38:52Z", "assignee": null, "author_association": "NONE", "issue_field_values": [], "type": null, "active_lock_reason": null, "sub_issues_summary": {"total": 0, "completed": 0, "percent_completed": 0}, "issue_dependencies_summary": {"blocked_by": 0, "total_blocked_by": 0, "blocking": 0, "total_blocking": 0}, "body": "Drone Device: Skydio X2\r\n\r\nWhen sending arming commands to the Skydio X2, it performs a long warm-up routine.\r\nWhile the warm-up routine is running, MAV_RESULT_IN_PROGRESS messages are sent.\r\nWhen the drone is finished warming up it returns a MAV_RESULT_ACCEPTED message.\r\n\r\nThis state flow is represented in MAVSDK/src/mavsdk/core/mavlink_command_sender.cpp.\r\n\r\nWhenever the second MAV_RESULT_IN_PROGRESS is sent, I get a Sigfault from mavsdk.\r\nIt occurs when freeing the memory of a promise. \r\n\u00a0\r\nThe \"call_callback(temp_callback, temp_result.first, temp_result.second);\" function inside  \r\n\"MavlinkCommandSender::receive_command_ack(mavlink_message_t message)\" is the start of the error stack.  \r\n\r\nDoes the dev team have any drones that return MAV_RESULT_IN_PROGRESS messages before success when arming?\r\nIs this an expected working feature. \r\nThe workflow does not work for the Skydio X2.\r\n\r\nInside MAVSDK/src/mavsdk/core/mavlink_command_sender.cpp:\r\nAll other case statement flows remove the job from the queue: \"_work_queue.erase(it)\"\r\nLikely, any job that reaches the call_callback function twice will cause a Sigfault. \r\nThe only jobs able to go through the case statement twice are jobs that are returned a PROGRESS message.\r\n\r\nCurrent mitigation: Disabling call_callback for any Progress message. \r\nMavlink seems to work perfectly fine with call_callback disabled for Progress message, must not be used anywhere crucial. \r\n\r\n```\r\n        if (temp_callback != nullptr) {\r\n            if (temp_result.first != Result::InProgress)\r\n            {\r\n                call_callback(temp_callback, temp_result.first, temp_result.second);\r\n            }\r\n        }\r\n```\r\n\r\n", "closed_by": {"login": "julianoes", "id": 1419688, "node_id": "MDQ6VXNlcjE0MTk2ODg=", "avatar_url": "https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1419688?v=4", "gravatar_id": "", "url": "https://api.github.com/users/julianoes", "html_url": "https://github.com/julianoes", "followers_url": "https://api.github.com/users/julianoes/followers", "following_url": "https://api.github.com/users/julianoes/following{/other_user}", "gists_url": "https://api.github.com/users/julianoes/gists{/gist_id}", "starred_url": "https://api.github.com/users/julianoes/starred{/owner}{/repo}", "subscriptions_url": "https://api.github.com/users/julianoes/subscriptions", "organizations_url": "https://api.github.com/users/julianoes/orgs", "repos_url": "https://api.github.com/users/julianoes/repos", "events_url": "https://api.github.com/users/julianoes/events{/privacy}", "received_events_url": "https://api.github.com/users/julianoes/received_events", "type": "User", "user_view_type": "public", "site_admin": false}, "reactions": {"url": "https://api.github.com/repos/mavlink/MAVSDK/issues/2319/reactions", "total_count": 0, "+1": 0, "-1": 0, "laugh": 0, "hooray": 0, "confused": 0, "heart": 0, "rocket": 0, "eyes": 0}, "timeline_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/mavlink/MAVSDK/issues/2319/timeline", "performed_via_github_app": null, "state_reason": "completed", "pinned_comment": null}, "comments": [{"url": "https://api.github.com/repos/mavlink/MAVSDK/issues/comments/2136423608", "html_url": "https://github.com/mavlink/MAVSDK/issues/2319#issuecomment-2136423608", "issue_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/mavlink/MAVSDK/issues/2319", "id": 2136423608, "node_id": "IC_kwDOBabE0s5_Vzy4", "user": {"login": "julianoes", "id": 1419688, "node_id": "MDQ6VXNlcjE0MTk2ODg=", "avatar_url": "https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1419688?v=4", "gravatar_id": "", "url": "https://api.github.com/